# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store

# Internal working documents. README.md carries the published reference set
# (forward model, gradients and sampler, WASP-39 b case, limitations,
# validation, data provenance) as sections; /notes.md is the local-only
# development diary, which also holds the merged negative-results register
# (## docs/failed_approaches.md section) and incident post-mortems: kept
# locally, not shipped to consumers.
# CLAUDE.md is untracked here too (2026-08-14), matching VULCAN-JAX and
# jwst-transit-authority: agent instructions are not part of a collaborator bundle.
# It used to be tracked so it would version with the code it governs; if that
# matters again, drop the line below and `git add -f CLAUDE.md`.
CLAUDE.md
/notes.md
examples/notes.md
runs/*/notes.md
scripts/zco_information/notes.md
validation/notes.md


# Large opacity/line-list caches -- NOT tracked. ExoJax downloads HITRAN line lists
# and CIA tables on first use (via the NAS proxy on HPC; see run_nas_w39b.pbs), and
# the ExoMol CO cache regenerates the same way. Total ~360 MB that git should not carry.
data/exojax_linelists/
data/opacity_cache/

# ExoMolOP k-tables (~389 MB/species; python -m vulcan_forward.fetch_exomolop)
# and the retired HITRAN-built correlated-k cache. Regenerable, 6+ GB total;
# note data/*.npz below does NOT match files inside these subdirectories.
data/exomolop/

# Run outputs (posteriors, checkpoints, logs, PBS job logs) -- regenerated per run
# ** so a nested run dir (a repo-root-relative SMC_RETRIEVAL_OUT_DIR
# resolved against the run dir) cannot escape the way runs/*/data/ did
runs/**/data/
runs/**/logs/
runs/**/plots/
runs/*/*.o[0-9]*
*.nsys-rep

# Generated npz caches (sensitivity/zco jacobians/walk) -- scientifically versioned
# by the code that writes them, regenerable, and easy to leave stale in git (the
# tracked set was deleted as stale 2026-07-11); never re-track them.
data/*.npz

# Editor / OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/

# Packaging build artifacts (pip install -e .)
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# jwst_tool runtime caches (model spectra + pandeia results) -- regenerated per run
data/jwst_tool/model_cache/
data/jwst_tool/noise_cache/

# Generated outputs (example/validation/zco npz caches) -- config.OUTPUTS
output/*
!output/.gitkeep
